    "id": "ag-final-vacated",
    "title": "Final and runway vacated",
    "shortExplanation": "Report final with your intention, then report the runway vacated.",
    "overview": [
      "At an uncontrolled aerodrome the final report tells the circuit that the runway will be occupied. Give the runway and your intention: full stop or touch-and-go.",
      "After landing, report the runway vacated once the whole aircraft is clear of it."
    ],
    "whyItMatters": "Pilots behind you decide whether to land or go around from your calls.",
    "references": [
      {
        "source": "ICAO Doc 9432 Manual of Radiotelephony",
        "section": "4.7 Final approach and landing"
      },
